govpx

This project is a pure-Go VP8 codec implementation scaffold inspired by libvpx.

Ported VP8 algorithms, when added, must cite the corresponding libvpx v1.16.0
source files in comments and preserve applicable copyright, license, and patent
notices.

Go-native SIMD primitives in internal/pixel/goav1_* are extracted from
goav1, copyright (c) 2025-2026 goav1 authors, under BSD-2-Clause.
See internal/pixel/UPSTREAM.md and third_party/goav1/ for provenance,
license, notices and the accompanying patent grant.
